# The IMR denies a request that is ready for them. Run package-encoder.cdp
# first, so both signed copies are in.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | verify_imr
type #login-password | Verify-scratch-pass!
click button[type=submit] | 
wait Requests
shot 20-qms-landing
click .nav-item | Requests
wait Waiting for your decision
shot 21-queue
click .series-row | VRF 1.01
wait Your decision
shot 22-request
type #imr-password | Verify-scratch-pass!
click button | Deny
wait Say why it is denied
type #imr-comments | The release window conflicts with FAM 6.03.
click button | Deny
wait Denied by the IMR
shot 23-denied
errors
